concept fact {
  name = "Fact"
  summary = "A unit that holds factual data — a value, a constant, a value table."
  audience = :both
  related = []
  body {
    p <<DOC
      A fact is a unit of knowledge that has a specific value and can't really be disputed or
      interpreted.
    DOC

    p <<DOC
      Some good examples of facts are like an API for a library. CPU Instructions. Details about
      historic events that happened.
    DOC
  }
}
